│                                                                    │
│ This means cache operation is controlled only by CSR state and not │
│ forced off in debug mode.                                          │
│                                                                    │
│  3 Best practices for the fix                                      │
│                                                                    │
│  • Keep changes minimal and localized.                             │
│  • Preserve existing cache behavior outside debug mode.            │
│  • Avoid architectural side effects in non-debug operation.        │
│  • Reuse existing debug_mode_i signal already present in IF stage. │
│                                                                    │
