│                                                                    │
│  1 Problem summary                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ The issue is that CHERIoT Ibex keeps instruction caching active    │
│ while the core is in debug mode.                                   │
│ This can return stale instructions (e.g., after debug-side memory  │
│ modification), causing incorrect execution behavior.               │
│                                                                    │
│  2 Where it occurs                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ From the provided context, the key point is in rtl/ibex_core.sv    │
│ where ibex_if_stage is instantiated and receives:                  │
│                                                                    │
│  • debug_mode_i (already connected),                               │
│  • icache_enable_i (currently connected directly to                │
│    icache_enable).                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ Because icache_enable_i is not qualified with ~debug_mode, the     │
│ I-cache remains active in debug mode.                              │
│                                                                    │
│  3 Best practices for the fix                                      │
│                                                                    │
│  • Keep the change minimal and localized.                          │
│  • Reuse existing debug_mode signal rather than introducing new    │
│    state.                                                          │
│  • Ensure behavior is consistent with upstream Ibex intent:        │
│    disable cache while in debug mode.                              │
│  • Avoid touching unrelated logic or tests.                        │
│                                                                    │
│  4 Fix approach                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│ Gate the IF-stage instruction cache enable with debug mode:        │
│                                                                    │
│  • Change:                                                         │
│     • icache_enable_i (icache_enable)                              │
│  • To:                                                             │
│     • icache_enable_i (icache_enable & ~debug_mode)                │
│                                                                    │
│ This cleanly disables instruction caching whenever debug mode is   │
│ active.                                                            │
