│                       Phase 1: FIX ANALYSIS                        │
│                                                                    │
│  1 Problem summary                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ The bug is that instruction caching remains active while the core  │
│ is in debug mode.                                                  │
│ That can cause incorrect debug behavior (stale instruction fetches │
│ / unexpected cached behavior), matching the upstream Ibex issue    │
│ and fix referenced.                                                │
│                                                                    │
│  2 Where it occurs                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ From the provided context, the key integration point is in:        │
│                                                                    │
│  • rtl/ibex_core.sv                                                │
│    The IF stage is instantiated with:                              │
│                                                                    │
│     .debug_mode_i   (debug_mode),                                  │
│     ...                                                            │
│     .icache_enable_i       (icache_enable),                        │
│                                                                    │
│    So debug state is known, but not used to suppress icache enable │
│    when passed into IF/cache logic.                                │
│                                                                    │
│  3 Best practices for the fix                                      │
│                                                                    │
│  • Keep behavior changes minimal and localized.                    │
│  • Reuse existing control signal (debug_mode) rather than          │
│    introducing new state.                                          │
│  • Ensure cache is effectively bypassed in debug mode without      │
│    changing normal mode behavior.                                  │
│  • Avoid broad refactors or touching unrelated modules/tests.      │
│                                                                    │
│  4 Fix approach                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│ Gate icache_enable with ~debug_mode when connecting into IF stage: │
│                                                                    │
│  • In normal operation: unchanged (icache_enable).                 │
│  • In debug mode: force icache disabled (0), so no caching         │
│    behavior while debugging.                                       │
│                                                                    │
│ ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── │
