╭─ Patch Generation ─────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│                       Phase 1: FIX ANALYSIS                        │
│                                                                    │
│  1 Problem summary                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ The issue is that when the core enters debug mode, instruction     │
│ fetches can still go through the instruction cache path. That can  │
│ cause stale/incorrect instruction behavior in debug flows          │
│ (matching upstream Ibex issue #1472).                              │
│                                                                    │
│  2 Where it occurs                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ From the provided context, the key connection is in:               │
│                                                                    │
│  • rtl/ibex_core.sv                                                │
│    ibex_if_stage instantiation currently passes:                   │
│     • .debug_mode_i   (debug_mode) (already available)             │
│     • .icache_enable_i (icache_enable) (not debug-qualified)       │
│                                                                    │
│ So IF/ICache remains enabled based only on CSR control, not on     │
│ debug state.                                                       │
│                                                                    │
│  3 Best practices for fix                                          │
│                                                                    │
│  • Keep the fix minimal and local.                                 │
│  • Reuse existing debug_mode signal instead of adding new state.   │
│  • Ensure behavior matches upstream intent: disable icache while   │
│    in debug mode.                                                  │
│  • Avoid broad structural changes or interface churn.              │
│                                                                    │
│  4 Fix approach                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│ Gate icache_enable_i with ~debug_mode at the core-to-IF            │
│ connection:                                                        │
│                                                                    │
│  • from: icache_enable                                             │
│  • to: icache_enable & ~debug_mode                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ This disables cache lookup/allocation while in debug mode and      │
│ forces uncached instruction fetch behavior in debug.               │
│                                                                    │
│ ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── │
│                    Phase 2: FIX IMPLEMENTATION                     │
│                                                                    │
│ ┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓ │
