│ overrides it.                                                      │
│                                                                    │
│ That means:                                                        │
│                                                                    │
│  • Under MML + EXEC, initialize access_fault = 1'b1.               │
│  • Otherwise, keep existing legacy default (MMWP || priv!=M).      │
