│ logic:                                                             │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│  // When MSECCFG.MMWP is set default deny always, otherwise allow  │
│  for M-mode, deny for other modes                                  │
│  access_fault = csr_pmp_i.mseccfg.mmwp || (priv_lvl_i !=           │
│  PRIV_LVL_M);                                                      │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│ This default is used when no PMP entry matches.                    │
│ With MML=1, this still allows M-mode (if MMWP=0) for all accesses, │
│ including execute, which violates Smepmp execute behavior.         │
│                                                                    │
