Based on the issue description we need to add an `axi_riscv_atomics_structs` instantiation immediately before the L2 SPM in Carfield.  This will require:

1. Modifying the Carfield top‐level SoC (where Cheshire currently does this for its main memory, debug, and IDMA ports) to also hook up the atomics block before the L2 SPM.
2. Adding the L2 port to the atomics module itself (so it can drive the SPM interface).
3. Updating the L2 SPM wrapper (so it exposes the right bus interface for atomics).
4. Adjusting Carfield’s address map/package (so that atomics sees the correct L2 address range).

Hence the four most likely files to edit are:

```
hw/carfield_soc.sv
hw/l2_spm.sv
hw/axi_riscv_atomics_structs.sv
hw/carfield_addr_map.sv
```
