│                       Phase 1: FIX ANALYSIS                        │
│                                                                    │
│  1 Problem statement                                               │
│                                                                    │
│ The issue is that AXI atomics handling (axi_riscv_atomics_structs) │
│ is missing on the path to the L2 SPM.                              │
│ As a result, AMO/LR/SC traffic targeting L2 SPM is not properly    │
│ handled, while other memories/targets already have this adapter in │
│ place.                                                             │
│                                                                    │
│  2 Where it occurs                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ In hw/carfield.sv, around the top-level AXI plumbing (near         │
│ mailbox/L2 external slave connectivity), there is currently no     │
│ dedicated axi_riscv_atomics_structs stage for the L2 slave ports   │
│ (L2Port1SlvIdx, L2Port2SlvIdx) before the L2 SPM side.             │
│                                                                    │
│  3 Best practices for the fix                                      │
│                                                                    │
│  • Keep AXI atomic support consistent across all memory-facing     │
│    paths.                                                          │
│  • Insert atomics adaptation as a small localized wrapper stage    │
│    rather than restructuring interconnect.                         │
│  • Use the same AXI request/response types already used at         │
│    top-level (carfield_axi_slv_req_t / carfield_axi_slv_rsp_t).    │
│  • Preserve existing behavior for non-atomic transactions.         │
│                                                                    │
│  4 How to fix                                                      │
│                                                                    │
│ Add two axi_riscv_atomics_structs adapters (one per L2 port) in    │
│ carfield.sv, creating intermediate request/response wires for L2,  │
│ so AXI traffic to L2Port1SlvIdx and L2Port2SlvIdx is               │
│ atomics-expanded before reaching L2 SPM.                           │
