│  1 Problem summary                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ The issue is that AXI atomics (RISC-V AMOs carried via AXI ATOPs)  │
│ are not converted/handled on the path to the L2 SPM in carfield.   │
│ Other memory-facing paths already use axi_riscv_atomics_structs    │
│ (as done in Cheshire), but L2 SPM currently misses this protection │
│ layer.                                                             │
│                                                                    │
