│ slave infrastructure includes two L2 slave ports (L2Port1SlvIdx,   │
│ L2Port2SlvIdx from carfield_pkg.sv).                               │
│ The missing part is the insertion of axi_riscv_atomics_structs on  │
│ those two L2-facing AXI slave paths before they reach the L2       │
│ memory subsystem.                                                  │
│                                                                    │
│  3 Best practices for the fix                                      │
