│  • Keep the topology unchanged except for inserting atomic         │
│    conversion where missing.                                       │
│  • Preserve AXI types and IDs/users unchanged through the wrapper. │
│  • Add the wrapper per L2 port (both L2 slave windows).            │
│  • Use minimal invasive wiring with dedicated intermediate         │
│    signals.                                                        │
│                                                                    │
│  4 How to fix                                                      │
