│                                                                    │
│  1 Problem summary                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ carfield must support RISC‑V atomics (AMO*, LR/SC) on all          │
│ memories.                                                          │
│ Unlike Cheshire, the path to the L2 SPM currently misses the       │
│ axi_riscv_atomics_structs stage, so atomic accesses can bypass the │
│ required AXI atomic handling/conversion logic.                     │
│                                                                    │
│  2 Where this occurs                                               │
│                                                                    │
│ From the provided context, the relevant integration point is in    │
│ hw/carfield.sv, around the AXI slave plumbing and the L2-related   │
│ slave indices (L2Port1SlvIdx, L2Port2SlvIdx).                      │
│ The fix belongs where top-level AXI slave interfaces are wired     │
│ before internal IPs are instantiated (the “Carfield IPs” section), │
│ so L2 receives traffic through atomics conversion.                 │
│                                                                    │
│  3 Best practices for the fix                                      │
│                                                                    │
│  • Keep the change local and minimal (don’t refactor unrelated AXI │
│    paths).                                                         │
│  • Insert atomics adapters in front of L2 SPM only.                │
│  • Preserve existing slave indexing (L2Port1SlvIdx,                │
│    L2Port2SlvIdx).                                                 │
│  • Reuse existing clock/reset for the L2 domain (l2_clk,           │
│    l2_rst_n).                                                      │
│  • Keep type-safe structured AXI interfaces                        │
│    (carfield_axi_slv_req_t/rsp_t).                                 │
│                                                                    │
│  4 How to fix                                                      │
│                                                                    │
│ Instantiate two axi_riscv_atomics_structs blocks (one per L2 port) │
│ before the L2 SPM-facing interfaces:                               │
│                                                                    │
│  • slave side connected to external slave slots                    │
│    (axi_slv_req/rsp[L2Port*SlvIdx])                                │
│  • master side connected to L2-local AXI ports (axi_l2_req/rsp[*]) │
│                                                                    │
│ This ensures all accesses to both L2 windows pass through atomic   │
│ handling.                                                          │
