5 # Common Cells Repository
6 
7 Maintainer: Nils Wistoff <nwistoff@iis.ee.ethz.ch>
8 
9 This repository contains commonly used cells and headers for use in various projects.
10 
11 ## Cell Contents
12 
13 This repository currently contains the following cells, ordered by categories.
14 Please note that cells with status *deprecated* are not to be used for new designs and only serve to provide compatibility with old code.
15 
