│    concepts (fork + dynamic subset), but no equivalent             │
│    dynamic+independent join implementation is exposed in the       │
│    provided context.                                               │
│  • src/stream_fork.sv is a good place to add the missing           │
│    “specular” functionality as a new module without disrupting     │
│    existing stream_join.                                           │
│  • README.md should be updated to document the new IP.             │
│                                                                    │
│  3 Best practices for the fix                                      │
│                                                                    │
│  • Keep backward compatibility: do not change existing             │
│    stream_join/stream_fork behavior.                               │
│  • Add a new module (stream_join_dynamic) rather than modifying    │
│    legacy semantics.                                               │
│  • Use a latched selection mask during an in-flight join           │
│    transaction to avoid mid-transaction sel_i changes corrupting   │
│    protocol progress.                                              │
│  • Keep handshake logic free of combinational loops and            │
│    synthesis-safe.                                                 │
