│                                                                    │
│  • Keep existing stream_fork behavior unchanged (backward          │
│    compatibility).                                                 │
│  • Add a new module rather than changing existing interfaces.      │
│  • Latch/track transaction progress internally so handshakes can   │
│    happen independently.                                           │
│  • Keep selected-input mask semantics clear: mask sampled at       │
│    transaction start.                                              │
│  • Preserve synthesizability and simple FSM/register style used in │
│    repository.                                                     │
│                                                                    │
