│                                                                    │
│  • Add a new module stream_join_dynamic (in src/stream_fork.sv)    │
│    with:                                                           │
│     • sel_i mask for dynamic subset selection,                     │
│     • per-input progress tracking (pending_q),                     │
│     • independent ready_o[i] assertion for still-pending selected  │
│       inputs,                                                      │
│     • valid_o raised once all selected inputs are collected,       │
│     • output handshake (valid_o && ready_i) completes transaction  │
│       and starts next.                                             │
