│                       Phase 1: FIX ANALYSIS                        │
│                                                                    │
│  1 Problem summary                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ popcount.sv is inconsistent about whether INPUT_WIDTH=1 is         │
│ supported:                                                         │
│                                                                    │
│  • The module parameter default is INPUT_WIDTH = 1, implying       │
│    support.                                                        │
│  • The description says only INPUT_WIDTH >= 2 is legal.            │
│  • More importantly, for INPUT_WIDTH=1, this declaration becomes   │
│    invalid:                                                        │
│                                                                    │
│     logic [PopcountWidth-2:0] left_child_result,                   │
│     right_child_result;                                            │
│                                                                    │
│    Since PopcountWidth = $clog2(1)+1 = 1, this turns into logic    │
│    [-1:0], which can crash tools (as reported for VCS).            │
│                                                                    │
│  2 Where it occurs                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ In src/popcount.sv:                                                │
│                                                                    │
│  • Description comment (legality statement of INPUT_WIDTH)         │
│  • Internal signal declaration of left_child_result /              │
│    right_child_result using PopcountWidth-2:0                      │
│                                                                    │
│  3 Best practices for fix                                          │
│                                                                    │
│  • Keep interface and recursion behavior unchanged.                │
│  • Avoid negative or empty packed ranges for all legal parameter   │
│    values.                                                         │
│  • Use a derived localparam to enforce a minimum internal vector   │
│    width of 1 bit.                                                 │
│  • Keep documentation aligned with actual supported parameter      │
│    range.                                                          │
