╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
╭─ Patch Generation ─────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│                       Phase 1: FIX ANALYSIS                        │
│                                                                    │
│                       1. What the problem is                       │
│                                                                    │
│ The synthesis error comes from Synopsys Synplify not accepting the │
│ use of $size(T) in this context:                                   │
│                                                                    │
│  • T is a type parameter                                           │
│  • $size() expects an array type, not an arbitrary type parameter  │
│  • Synplify reports: “Expecting array type”                        │
│                                                                    │
│ So the code is legal enough for simulation tools like Questa, but  │
│ not accepted by this synthesis tool.                               │
│                                                                    │
│                    2. Where the problem occurs                     │
│                                                                    │
│ The problem is in src/stream_register.sv, in the instantiation of  │
│ fifo_v2:                                                           │
│                                                                    │
│  • DATA_WIDTH is set to $size(T)                                   │
│  • fifo_v2 already has a dtype type parameter                      │
│  • therefore the width parameter should be derived in a way that   │
│    is compatible with synthesis                                    │
│                                                                    │
│ Relevant location:                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│  • src/stream_register.sv, lines around the fifo_v2 #(...)         │
│    instantiation                                                   │
│                                                                    │
│               3. Best practices to take into account               │
│                                                                    │
│  • Prefer synthesis-friendly SystemVerilog constructs when         │
│    targeting Synplify or similar tools                             │
│  • Avoid $size() on a type parameter unless the tool explicitly    │
│    supports it                                                     │
│  • Use $bits() for bit-width extraction from types; it is the      │
│    standard way to get the packed bit width of a type              │
│  • Keep the fix minimal and localized to avoid changing behavior   │
│    unnecessarily                                                   │
│                                                                    │
│                     4. How to fix the problem                      │
│                                                                    │
│ Replace:                                                           │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│  .DATA_WIDTH ($size(T))                                            │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│ with:                                                              │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│  .DATA_WIDTH ($bits(T))                                            │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│ This preserves the intended data width calculation and is accepted │
│ by Synplify.                                                       │
│                                                                    │
│ ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── │
│                    Phase 2: FIX IMPLEMENTATION                     │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│  [file]src/stream_register.sv[/file]                               │
│  [original]    fifo_v2 #(                                          │
│          .FALL_THROUGH   (1'b0),                                   │
│          .DATA_WIDTH     ($size(T)),                               │
│          .DEPTH          (1),                                      │
│          .dtype          (T)                                       │
│      ) i_fifo (                                                    │
│  [/original]                                                       │
│  [patched]    fifo_v2 #(                                           │
│          .FALL_THROUGH   (1'b0),                                   │
│          .DATA_WIDTH     ($bits(T)),                               │
│          .DEPTH          (1),                                      │
│          .dtype          (T)                                       │
│      ) i_fifo (                                                    │
│  [/patched]                                                        │
│                                                                    │
