╭─ Patch Generation ─────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│                       Phase 1: FIX ANALYSIS                        │
│                                                                    │
│                         1. Problem summary                         │
│                                                                    │
│ The issue is an off-by-one error in the loop bound used to         │
│ populate halted_flat1 from halted_reshaped0 in src/dm_csrs.sv.     │
│                                                                    │
│ The array halted_reshaped0 is declared with the range:             │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│  logic [(NrHarts-1)/2**5:0][31:0] halted_reshaped0;                │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│ So its valid indices are 0 .. (NrHarts-1)/2**5.                    │
│                                                                    │
│ However, the loop currently uses:                                  │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│  for (int unsigned k = 0; k < NrHarts/2**5+1; k++) begin           │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│ This can iterate one element too far and access a non-existent     │
│ array index, depending on NrHarts.                                 │
│                                                                    │
│                    2. Where the problem occurs                     │
│                                                                    │
│ The bug is in src/dm_csrs.sv, inside the p_reduction1 always_comb  │
│ block, around the loop:                                            │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│  for (int unsigned k = 0; k < NrHarts/2**5+1; k++) begin           │
│    halted_flat1[k] = |halted_reshaped0[k];                         │
│  end                                                               │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│ This is the only location that needs fixing for the reported       │
│ issue.                                                             │
│                                                                    │
│                   3. Best practices to consider                    │
│                                                                    │
│  • Use array bounds that exactly match the declared size.          │
│  • Prefer expressions derived from the array declaration when      │
│    indexing or looping over packed/unpacked arrays.                │
│  • Avoid ambiguous arithmetic precedence in bounds; parenthesize   │
│    expressions explicitly.                                         │
│  • Make the fix minimal and localized to avoid unintended side     │
│    effects.                                                        │
│                                                                    │
│                          4. How to fix it                          │
│                                                                    │
│ Change the loop upper bound from:                                  │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│  NrHarts/2**5+1                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│ to:                                                                │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│  (NrHarts-1)/2**5+1                                                │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│ This matches the declared size of halted_reshaped0 and prevents    │
│ out-of-range access.                                               │
│                                                                    │
│ ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── │
│                    Phase 2: FIX IMPLEMENTATION                     │
