│  • Keep compatibility: the fix should not affect non-FPGA or       │
│    non-Xilinx flows.                                               │
│                                                                    │
│                     4. How to fix the problem                      │
│                                                                    │
│ The correct fix is to add the missing header file axi_flat.svh to  │
│ the repository, containing the macro definitions used by           │
│ occamy_xilinx.sv.                                                  │
│                                                                    │
│ Since the issue is specifically that the file is missing, the      │
│ minimal and proper resolution is to restore that header rather     │
│ than modifying all macro call sites or removing the include.       │
